flowchart RL
    N0{{Archive}}
    N1{Report emit}
    N2([Report parse])
    N3([Fetch])
    N4{Retry}
    N5[Archive load]
    N6[Check]
    N7{Parse report}
    N8{Emit report}
    N0 --> N1
